WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:19.600
What is a transformer?

2
00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:40.050
Start with one small job.

3
00:00:40.050 --> 00:01:02.600
Break the input into pieces.

4
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:20.900
Give each piece a number pattern.

5
00:01:20.900 --> 00:01:42.250
Keep track of the order.

6
00:01:42.250 --> 00:02:03.600
Connect the useful pieces.

7
00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:27.050
Try several attention patterns.

8
00:02:27.050 --> 00:02:48.850
Refine what each piece represents.

9
00:02:48.850 --> 00:03:15.200
Repeat the processing in layers.

10
00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:37.550
Turn the result into a prediction.

11
00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:56.750
Structure, learning and prediction

12
00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:18.950
Three ways to see the same idea
